<p>Find a vector parametric equation <m>\vec{r}(t)</m> for the line through the points <m>P = \left(3,2,4\right)</m> and <m>Q = \left(4,1,1\right)</m>.</p>
<p><m>\vec{r}(t) =</m> <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p>Find a vector parametric equation <m>\vec{r}(t)</m> for the line through the points <m>P = \left(1,-1,5\right)</m> and <m>Q = \left(-4,1,0\right)</m>.</p>
<p><m>\vec{r}(t) =</m> <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(-2,4\right)+t\mathopen{}\left&lt;3,4\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(3,2,4\right)+t\mathopen{}\left&lt;1,-1,-3\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(1,-1,5\right)+t\mathopen{}\left&lt;-5,2,-5\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
